--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Audit log records carry `"decision": "allow"` or `"deny"` in place of `"allowed": true/false`. Older logs are not read.
 - A rule can name several roles separated by commas (`allow viewer,auditor read reports/**`); it applies to anyone holding any of them.
 
 ## 0.4.0
